
  Skincare store ΓÇö local development (sandbox)

    site      http://localhost:8787/
    admin     http://localhost:8787/admin/
    api       http://localhost:8787/health
    media     C:\Users\user\Documents\Automation\dodumodu-commerce\dodumodu_backend\.media

    env file  root .env
    database  postgresql://postgres:***@127.0.0.1:55432/postgres

  Pay Now needs OPay sandbox credentials in .env; pay on delivery works offline.
  Turnstile is off locally (no secret set) ΓÇö orders skip bot verification.
  /admin is open locally as admin@dodumodu.local (no Cloudflare Access in front of it).
